      "description": "The no-photo local-listing state; photography replaces this well when supplied.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><button class=\"ds-photo\" aria-label=\"Open Adjustable metal desk lamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 7h14l2 14H3L5 7Zm3 0V5a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2\"/></svg><span>A good find, photo coming later.</span></button><p class=\"ds-meta\">Room essentials \u00b7 Local listing</p><div class=\"ds-title-row\"><button class=\"ds-title\">Adjustable metal desk lamp</button><strong class=\"ds-price\">\u20b9550</strong></div><div class=\"ds-seller\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">DA</span><span>Dev Arora<small>MBA \u00b7 2027</small></span><span class=\"ds-pickup\">Pick up: North Campus</span></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{max-width:290px;color:var(--ink);font-family:\"DM Sans\",sans-serif;}.ds-photo{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;aspect-ratio:1.04;width:100%;padding:18px;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:var(--mint);color:var(--muted);font:400 13px/1.6 \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;}.ds-photo:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:-5px;}.ds-meta{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 7px;}.ds-title-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;}.ds-title{border:0;background:none;color:inherit;padding:0;text-align:left;font:600 15px/1.5 \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.015em;cursor:pointer;}.ds-title:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-title:active,.ds-photo:active{transform:scale(.975);}.ds-price{font:750 24px/1.1 var(--serif);white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-seller{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:13px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:10px;}.ds-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#eedde2;font-size:9px;}.ds-seller small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);}.ds-pickup{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-title:hover{color:var(--accent);}}@media(max-width:1150px){.ds-seller{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px 8px;}.ds-pickup{grid-column:1/-1;margin-left:0;font-size:10px;line-height:1.6;white-space:normal;}.ds-title-row{flex-direction:column;gap:5px;}}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-photo{aspect-ratio:1/1.1;border-radius:4px;}.ds-title{font-size:13px;min-height:39px;letter-spacing:0;}.ds-price{font-size:24px;}}"
